)\nという子です。参考資料として一緒に撮った写真と三面図を添付します。\n表情は少しは赤面している感じでお願いしたいですが、ポーズや構図など細かいところはお任せします。\n\n使用アバター\n\nライム Lime\nhttps://komado.booth.pm/items/4876459\n\nシアン Cian\nhttps://septem47.booth.pm/items/5482062\n\n衣装\n\nArtemisSailor\nhttps://silverspace.booth.pm/items/4222837\n\n愛されミディアムヘア\nhttps://fiona.booth.pm/items/4204593\n\nふわふわなボブヘア\nhttps://li-ne.booth.pm/items/5262479\n\n以上です。よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jONlVAzQkKXyrp7M4-UBg-eOEynPs7kc?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kitsunekazsa/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8a97ace8/uploads/origins/529d9986-8c33-40bc-a2fd-21aa4b0042cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=47ef1d5d2e14b959e2b70fbc8dc89af8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8a97ace8/uploads/origins/529d9986-8c33-40bc-a2fd-21aa4b0042cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=47ef1d5d2e14b959e2b70fbc8dc89af8, https://si.imgix.net/8a97ace8/uploads/origins/529d9986-8c33-40bc-a2fd-21aa4b0042cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=765ea04c64a4bb3e99685519c2979f3d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8a97ace8/uploads/origins/529d9986-8c33-40bc-a2fd-21aa4b0042cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3184fa027acc28fee5683ffedea20c23 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kitsunekazsa/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dac84179/uploads/origins/565ff4a5-7f95-4eb7-80f5-c425e3a4383f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm